      "username": "Phantom5613",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantom5613/{size}/1906_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-12-18T15:09:23.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Christopher and Adam gave us a tool-box to use how we each see fit. Some of us will use them happily, thankful we won't have to go and&nbsp;make our own. Others, for one reason or another,&nbsp;won't use them. It's all gravy.</p>\n<p>I personally plan on using the cannon wherever I can, with maybe a tweak here or there. (I want the possibility of the main line being opened up to the rest of the multiverse to be a thing but not immediatly avaliable to my players)</p>",
